  m_text: 'Trained in the desert heat by its ruthless master, this creature is known
    in mythology as the ruler of the skies. According to legends, no one has ever
    faced this mysterious monster, which draws power from fire, and survived. The
    only traces of its existence are burnt fields and villages engulfed in flames.

'
