  m_text: A little curiosity and some lucky engineering feat granted this Ottoman
    the extraordinary ability of flight! He likes to drop death from above thanks
    to his timed bombs. His agility gives him an immunity to ground fire, and makes
    him a very deadly weapon for unprepared defenses and cities.
